            "show_accordion_divider": false,
            "line_thickness": "normal",
            "accordion_heading": "How Collagen Work",
            "heading_style": "font-heading",
            "accordion_text": "<p>As the body ages, natural collagen levels decline, leading to reduced elasticity, wrinkles, and dryness. Calmerceuticals Premium Liquid Collagen is designed to combat these effects, targeting dull, tired-looking skin and visible signs of ageing.</p><p>Each serving contains 10,000mg of Type 1 hydrolysed marine collagen, clinically proven to improve skin elasticity and reduce wrinkles. Enriched with hyaluronic acid, Cultavit®, polyphenols, and essential vitamins C and D, it delivers deep hydration and supports optimal collagen performance within the body.</p><p>Crafted with the highest quality ingredients in Australian laboratories, Calmerceuticals ensures safety, efficacy, and superior results. A daily sachet helps rebuild and restore collagen levels, boosting your body’s natural collagen and hyaluronic acid production. Each box contains 14 ready-to-drink sachets for convenient, effective beauty support.</p>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "product_accordion_xjcMLe": {
          "type": "product_accordion",
          "settings": {
            "show_description": false,
            "show_read_more": true,
            "enable_full_width": false,
            "tabs_bg_color": "",
            "show_accordion_divider": false,
            "line_thickness": "normal",
            "accordion_heading": "How CalmerCeuticals Collagen Works",
            "heading_style": "font-heading",
            "accordion_text": "<p>As we age, the body’s natural collagen production slows down, leading to a loss of skin elasticity, firmness, and hydration - and the visible signs of ageing such as wrinkles, fine lines, and dryness begin to appear.</p><p>Each daily sachet of Calmerceuticals Premium Liquid Collagen delivers 10,000 mg of Type I hydrolysed marine collagen, clinically shown to support the body’s natural collagen matrix. Once ingested, these bioactive collagen peptides are efficiently absorbed into the bloodstream and transported to the deeper layers of the skin, where they help stimulate and boost the body’s own collagen synthesis.</p><p>This internal support system promotes skin rejuvenation from within — helping to restore firmness and elasticity, reduce the appearance of wrinkles, and reveal a smoother, more radiant complexion.</p>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
