            "accordion_text": "<p><strong>Mixed Berry Flavour:</strong><br/>Marine Hydrolysed Collagen, Water, Organic Shiitake Mushroom Powder (Vitamin D), Acerola Juice Powder (Vitamin C), Fermented Kakadu Plum (Vitamin C), Silica, Citric Acid, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Cranberry Extract (Vitamin C and E), Pomegranate Extract (Vitamins C and K), Grape Skin Extract (Vitamins C and E), Aronia (Chokeberry) Extract (Vitamin C), Blueberry Juice Powder (Vitamins C, K and E), Hyaluronic Acid, Buckwheat Seed Powder (Cultavit) (B Vitamins), Thaumatin, Red Beet Colour Powder, Natural Mixed Berry Flavour.</p><p><strong>Mango & Mandarin Flavour:</strong><br/>Marine Hydrolysed Collagen, Water, Organic Shiitake Mushroom Powder (Vitamin D), Acerola Juice Powder (Vitamin C), Fermented Kakadu Plum (Vitamin C), Silica, Citric Acid, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Cranberry Extract (Vitamins C and E), Pomegranate Extract (Vitamins C and K), Grape Skin Extract (Vitamins C and E), Aronia (Chokeberry) Extract (Vitamin C), Blueberry Juice Powder (Vitamins C, K and E), Hyaluronic Acid, Buckwheat Seed Powder (Cultavit) (B Vitamins), Thaumatin, Natural Mandarin Flavour, Natural Mango Flavour, Turmeric Powder.</p>",
