    "section_accordions_HUdDKH": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_UzXpCb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is VERISOL® Enhanced Marine Collagen?",
            "text": "<p>VERISOL® Enhanced Marine Collagen is a premium, gold-standard liquid collagen supplement designed to support healthy, youthful-looking skin from within. It combines clinically proven marine collagen peptides with a powerful blend of vitamins, antioxidants, and botanicals to improve skin elasticity, reduce wrinkles, and promote overall vitality. Conveniently packaged in single-serve sachets, it’s an easy daily ritual for radiant skin, stronger hair and nails, and enhanced wellbeing.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_bx9WKg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long should I use Calmerceuticals Collagen to see results?",
            "text": "<p>Clinical research shows visible results from Calmerceuticals Collagen in as little as 8–12 weeks of consistent daily use. This is the scientifically proven timeframe to support skin elasticity, smooth the appearance of wrinkles, and enhance overall vitality. For best results, we recommend making it part of your daily routine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_TCCMAn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I take Calmerceuticals Collagen if pregnant or breastfeeding?",
            "text": "<p>Our products are made with naturally sourced, premium ingredients and are independently tested for quality and safety. However, pregnancy and breastfeeding are unique experiences for everyone. We recommend consulting your doctor or a healthcare professional for personalized advice before using any supplement, including Calmerceuticals Collagen.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_eymWzc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why is Calmerceuticals collagen more expensive than other brands?",
            "text": "<p>At Calmerceuticals, we believe in delivering results you can see and feel. Our pricing reflects the clinical-grade quality, scientifically backed ingredients, and comprehensive formulation behind every sachet.<br/>Each formula is crafted with exceptional, research-proven ingredients - including 10,000 mg of VERISOL® marine collagen, shown to improve skin elasticity and reduce wrinkles in as little as 8–12 weeks. We also include premium bioactives like fermented Kakadu Plum (for natural Vitamin C), Hyaluronic Acid, and B-Complex to support absorption, hydration, and overall vitality. This is not a cheap product - it is a gold-standard formulation designed for those who value real, visible results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_RPcecJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Calmerceuticals Collagen suitable for people with allergies?",
            "text": "<p>Our formula is gluten-free, dairy-free, and soy-free, making it suitable for many dietary needs. However, as it contains marine collagen, it is not suitable for those with fish allergies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_tqLMF8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Calmerceuticals Collagen gluten-free?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our collagen supplement is gluten-free and made with carefully selected, clean ingredients</p>"
          }
        }
      },
